Hello, world!

I'm Matt (aka smallwat3r), a Senior Software Engineer, originally from
France and now based in London, UK, where I moved a decade ago. I love
Emacs, have a mild addiction to custom keyboards, and enjoy hacking and
crafting new things.

You'll often find me behind a cup of coffee, or geeking out over craft
beer and homebrewing. I also believe that if you have a cat, you're
probably a good person.

On this blog, I write about code and various other things.

You can find my CV [here](/cv).

